sequenceDiagram
    actor Assignee
    participant API
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant Engine
    Assignee->>API: Complete task with values and idempotency key
    API->>PostgreSQL: Lock instance and verify task access and state
    API->>Engine: Validate pinned form
    Engine->>PostgreSQL: Persist submission and advance token
    Engine->>PostgreSQL: Commit downstream state, receipt and event
    API-->>Assignee: 200 with result
